NAME
        bal asyncapi - Generate a Ballerina listener from an AsyncAPI contract,
                       or generate an AsyncAPI specification from a Ballerina service file.

SYNOPSIS
        bal asyncapi <http|ws> [flags]

DESCRIPTION
        Generate a Ballerina source from the given AsyncAPI definition file, or generate
        an AsyncAPI specification from a Ballerina service file.

        The generated Ballerina sources and AsyncAPI specification will be written into
        the provided output location.

OPTIONS
        -h, --help
                Display help for the parent command or a subcommand.

EXAMPLES
        Display help for the http subcommand.
            $ bal asyncapi http --help

        Display help for the ws subcommand.
            $ bal asyncapi ws --help
